[*] AoU layout : cocotb write_read_test - one write, then the read-back.
[*]
[*] Emphasis: the WRITE half of the chain end to end (AW/W -> WriteReq/WriteData
[*] flit -> memory write -> WriteResp flit -> B), then the READ that must return
[*] the same word.  The memory's captured write address/data/strobe sit next to
[*] the AXI beat so a wrong-word write is one glance.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=cocotb
